{"book":19,"chapter":1,"rubric":"A HEADLESS SERVER / CHAPTER 1","slides":[{"title":"A server without a screen","sub":"Chapter 1 · A headless server","short":"No screen","main":"The only path to the server is a shell, so keep a way back.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Rack","Shell","Risk","Habit"],"captions":["The server is in a rack or a cloud: no monitor, no keyboard","The only way in is a remote command line","A mistake in access means a lost server","Every access change comes with a way back"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"rack or cloud, no screen","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"rack or cloud, no screen","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"the only path: a shell over SSH","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"rack or cloud, no screen","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"the only path: a shell over SSH","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"an access error = a lost server","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"rack or cloud, no screen","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"the only path: a shell over SSH","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"an access error = a lost server","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":180.0,"y":122.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"an edit with a way back","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[10.7,18.0,25.1]}]},{"title":"Handshake and host key","sub":"Chapter 1 · A headles